    skos:scopeNote "Fine to coarse grained, cream to green/grey coloured oolitic limestone. Quarried since Roman times, it is one of Britain's best building stones, hence its use throughout the country."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/98131> a skos:Concept ;
