    skos:scopeNote "Hard, transparent, often coloured mineral. Can be found on its own as crystals and veins but also as a major constituent of rocks such as granite. Often used decoratively."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/98134> a skos:Concept ;
