    skos:scopeNote "Medium grained, hard, white/grey coloured stone consisting of quartz and often silica, produced by the metamorphosis of sandstone."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/98143> a skos:Concept ;
