    skos:scopeNote "The tall, straight stalks or stems formed by plants found in the wetland areas, particularly The Fens. Used as a roofing material, the reed is laid with the ends forming the exposed covering surface."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/98144> a skos:Concept ;
