    skos:related <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/98028> ;
    skos:scopeNote "Soft, medium grained, green/grey coloured, highly calcareous, cretaceous sandstone. Mined (more frequently than quarried) since pre-Norman times from the Reigate area of Surrey."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/98145> a skos:Concept ;
