    skos:scopeNote "Aggregate, cement and mortar combined with structural elements of iron or steel mesh or rod reinforcement to form stonelike masses for load bearing, structural building work."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/98164> a skos:Concept ;
