    skos:scopeNote "The remains of living organisms preserved in stone over a long time period. This may be the internal or external moulds of, usually, the hard parts of an organism (shells, bones, etc.)."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/97947> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/98046> ;
