    skos:scopeNote "Structural board comprising a core of thin layers of wood bonded together, which is faced on one or both sides with a sheet of metal, usually galvanised steel or aluminium. Mainly used for external wall cladding."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/eh_tbm/concepts/98118> a skos:Concept ;
